    "html": "<div style=\"--color-broadcast-burgundy:#390a1a;--color-on-air-coral:#f73b3b;--color-hot-take-red:#ff5340;--color-plum-mid:#651a39;--color-warm-parchment:#faf8f7;--color-pure-white:#ffffff;--color-dusty-rose:#a28993;--font-booton:'Source Sans Pro',IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif;--font-gamuth-display:'Playfair Display',Fraunces,serif;--font-brett:'Courier Prime','Space Mono',monospace;box-sizing:border-box;background:var(--color-broadcast-burgundy);padding:56px 40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:32px;width:600px;font-family:var(--font-booton);\">\n  <div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-brett);font-size:18px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--color-on-air-coral);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1;\">AI VIDEO EDITOR</div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-gamuth-display);font-size:40px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);margin:0 0 16px 0;line-height:1.15;\">AI-editing for every kind of video</h2>\n    <p style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:18px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-dusty-rose);margin:0;line-height:1.56;letter-spacing:-0.02em;max-width:460px;\">Direct your AI co-editor to do your video editing for you, or do it yourself with intuitive editing tools.</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:16px;width:100%;\">\n    <a href=\"#\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:var(--color-on-air-coral);color:var(--color-pure-white);font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:18px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-0.02em;padding:16px 40px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;line-height:1;\">Get started for free</a>\n    <a href=\"#\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:16px;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.02em;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(144,117,128,0.5);cursor:pointer;line-height:1;\">Contact sales</a>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Primary CTA Button Group",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<div style=\"--color-broadcast-burgundy:#390a1a;--color-muted-plum:#583f4a;--color-warm-parchment:#faf8f7;--color-on-air-coral:#f73b3b;--color-dusty-rose:#a28993;--color-border-mauve:#907580;--color-blush-mist:#f1eaed;--color-ink-dark:#1a1a1a;--font-booton:'Source Sans Pro',IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif;--font-gamuth-display:'Playfair Display',Fraunces,serif;--font-brett:'Courier Prime','Space Mono',monospace;box-sizing:border-box;background:var(--color-broadcast-burgundy);padding:48px 32px;width:600px;font-family:var(--font-booton);\">\n  <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px;\">\n    <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-brett);font-size:18px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--color-on-air-coral);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px;line-height:1;\">Social Proof</div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-gamuth-display);font-size:40px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);margin:0;line-height:1.15;\">Don't just take our word for it</h2>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;\">\n    <div style=\"background:var(--color-muted-plum);border-radius:4px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-mauve);\">\n      <p style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);line-height:1.56;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 20px 0;\">&ldquo;Descript has made cleaning up and creating my educational videos into professional presentations without needing extensive technical skills.&rdquo;</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9999px;background:#c47a4a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);flex-shrink:0;\">B</div>\n        <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);letter-spacing:-0.02em;\">Barbara C.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background:var(--color-muted-plum);border-radius:4px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-mauve);\">\n      <p style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);line-height:1.56;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 20px 0;\">&ldquo;Descript makes recording and editing audio and video a breeze. Its advanced features have streamlined my workflows, saving a lot of time.&rdquo;</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--color-border-mauve);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);flex-shrink:0;\">R</div>\n        <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);letter-spacing:-0.02em;\">Roderick F.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background:var(--color-muted-plum);border-radius:4px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-mauve);\">\n      <p style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);line-height:1.56;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 20px 0;\">&ldquo;The collaborative tools streamline teamwork, allowing my team and me to work efficiently together on projects. Descript enhances productivity and simplifies the editing process.&rdquo;</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9999px;background:#5a7a4a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);flex-shrink:0;\">A</div>\n        <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);letter-spacing:-0.02em;\">Aldrich M.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"background:var(--color-muted-plum);border-radius:4px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-mauve);\">\n      <p style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:15px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);line-height:1.56;letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin:0 0 20px 0;\">&ldquo;Transcription-based editing makes the process much faster&hellip;All in all, a must have editor for most audiences, especially in SaaS marketing.&rdquo;</p>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;\">\n        <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:9999px;background:#7a6a8a;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);flex-shrink:0;\">N</div>\n        <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-warm-parchment);letter-spacing:-0.02em;\">Nidhin M.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Testimonial Card Grid",
    "role": "",
    "description": ""
  },
  {
    "html": "<div style=\"--color-warm-parchment:#faf8f7;--color-on-air-coral:#f73b3b;--color-border-mauve:#907580;--color-ink-dark:#1a1a1a;--color-broadcast-burgundy:#390a1a;--color-plum-mid:#651a39;--color-dusty-rose:#a28993;--color-blush-mist:#f1eaed;--font-booton:'Source Sans Pro',IBM Plex Sans,sans-serif;--font-gamuth-display:'Playfair Display',Fraunces,serif;--font-brett:'Courier Prime','Space Mono',monospace;box-sizing:border-box;background:var(--color-broadcast-burgundy);padding:40px 32px;width:600px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--font-booton);\">\n  <div style=\"background:var(--color-warm-parchment);border-radius:4px;padding:32px;width:100%;max-width:420px;\">\n    <div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:24px;\">\n      <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-brett);font-size:18px;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--color-on-air-coral);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;line-height:1;\">2025</div>\n      <h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-gamuth-display);font-size:32px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-plum-mid);margin:0;line-height:1.15;\">Best Software</h3>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n      <div style=\"background:#1a1050;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;min-width:68px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#f0c040;letter-spacing:0.02em;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;\">BEST SOFTWARE</div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:8px;font-weight:400;color:#e0d8f0;line-height:1.4;\">2025</div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.2;\">Top 50</div>\n        <div style=\"width:20px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f73b3b,#f0c040);border-radius:2px;margin:4px auto 0;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#1a1050;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;min-width:68px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#c0b0e0;letter-spacing:0.02em;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;\">FALL 2025</div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.4;\">Best Results</div>\n        <div style=\"width:20px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#8040c0,#c0b0e0);border-radius:2px;margin:4px auto 0;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#1a1050;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;min-width:68px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#c0b0e0;letter-spacing:0.02em;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;\">FALL 2025</div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.4;\">Leader</div>\n        <div style=\"width:20px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f73b3b,#f0a000);border-radius:2px;margin:4px auto 0;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#1a1050;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;min-width:68px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#c0b0e0;letter-spacing:0.02em;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;\">FALL 2025</div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.4;\">Momentum Leader</div>\n        <div style=\"width:20px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4080f0,#40c0f0);border-radius:2px;margin:4px auto 0;\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"background:#1a1050;border-radius:6px;padding:8px 10px;text-align:center;min-width:68px;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#c0b0e0;letter-spacing:0.02em;line-height:1.2;text-transform:uppercase;\">FALL 2025</div>\n        <div style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:8px;font-weight:600;color:#ffffff;line-height:1.4;\">Most Implementable</div>\n        <div style=\"width:20px;height:3px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#4080f0,#8040c0);border-radius:2px;margin:4px auto 0;\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;justify-content:center;\">\n      <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-ink-dark);letter-spacing:-0.02em;padding:7px 16px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-mauve);border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;line-height:1;\">Video Editing</span>\n      <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-ink-dark);letter-spacing:-0.02em;padding:7px 16px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-mauve);border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;line-height:1;\">AI Video Generators</span>\n      <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-ink-dark);letter-spacing:-0.02em;padding:7px 16px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-mauve);border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;line-height:1;\">Screen and Video Capture</span>\n      <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-booton);font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:var(--color-ink-dark);letter-spacing:-0.02em;padding:7px 16px;border:1px solid var(--color-border-mauve);border-radius:9999px;background:transparent;line-height:1;\">Text to Speech</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
    "name": "Awards Recognition Card with Category Tags",
